{"schema_version":1,"key":"dish-bb2673fc51ec","reference_recipes":[{"id":"howtocook-bb2673fc51ec","name":"朱雀汤","category":"soup","url":"https://github.com/Anduin2017/HowToCook/blob/0e106eea348c734fe1586f781202994439cf98a5/dishes/soup/%E6%9C%B1%E9%9B%80%E6%B1%A4/%E6%9C%B1%E9%9B%80%E6%B1%A4.md","blob_sha":"e99d2ec13f5e70917d1c15db3a01da003a0fff04","details":{"introduction":"朱雀汤是一道豫东地区的家常快手汤品，口感顺滑香甜，带着芝麻油的醇香。鸡蛋提供优质蛋白质，制作非常简单，只需烧水冲蛋几步就能完成，前后不到十分钟即可上桌，还有清热去火的效果。","difficulty":"★","sections":[{"heading":"必备原料和工具","markdown":"- 鸡蛋\n- 香油（芝麻油）\n- 白糖\n- 水"},{"heading":"计算","markdown":"按照 1 人份的份量：\n\n- 一个鸡蛋\n- 500ml 水\n- 20 克白糖（根据个人口味调整）\n- 2ml 香油"},{"heading":"操作","markdown":"1. 鸡蛋在碗中打散，再倒入香油。\n2. 水烧开后，在沸腾状态下快速倒入盛有鸡蛋的碗中。\n3. 放入白糖。"},{"heading":"附加内容","markdown":"- 鸡蛋一定要打散，水一定要在沸腾冒泡状态倒入鸡蛋液中，否则汤可能会浑浊影响口感\n- 此为豫东地区做法，其他地区有不放白糖放盐的，口味不同，根据个人口味调整\n- 此汤乃去火神器！"}]}}],"nutrition":{"status":"reference","basis":"per_100g","serving_g":null,"scope":"2–3人家庭标准配方估算：净全鸡蛋液150g、芝麻香油8g、白砂糖20g、饮用水800g；整份约900g。甜口，所有蛋花、汤和香油全部食用。净量及成品重为明确标准假设，非实测；未做烹饪损失校正，所有列入的油糖酱均计入。","per_100g":{"energy_kcal":40.291111,"protein_g":2.1,"carbohydrate_g":2.342222,"fat_g":2.473889},"source":{"name":"USDA FoodData Central","url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171287/nutrients","version":"f6dfb92528da2524","fdc_ids":[171287,171016,169655,173647]},"profile_id":"family-bb2673fc51ec-v1","recipe_id":"howtocook-bb2673fc51ec","review_status":"approved","method":"usda_recipe_estimate","recipe_basis":"standardized_assumptions","is_estimate":true,"match":{"food_identity":"howtocook-bb2673fc51ec","state":"ready_to_eat","cooking_method":"simmer","edible_part":"explicit_net_edible_ingredients_without_bones_shells_or_discarded_parts","oil_added":true,"sugar_added":true,"sauce_added":false,"brand":null,"variant":"family-bb2673fc51ec-v1","standard_ingredients":[{"key":"egg","grams":150},{"key":"sesame_oil","grams":8},{"key":"sugar","grams":20},{"key":"water","grams":800}],"excludes":["不同主料、品种、品牌、用量、含水量或额外配料","带骨带壳毛重、丢弃汤汁或锅中残油的实